WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.575
Broke again... Why do I always end up like this?

2
00:00:08.725 --> 00:00:14.250
Was I born just to be an extra?

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.101
Fired again... Fantastic.

4
00:00:21.251 --> 00:00:29.171
If there's a next life, please let me be a bit more capable.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.400
Whoa... wait—

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.800
Where the hell is this? Am I dead?

7
00:00:53.715 --> 00:00:58.915
Two... moons?

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:09.968
System: Welcome, User Time. PureFxAi System activated.

9
00:01:10.118 --> 00:01:14.250
A system...? Just like in a game.

10
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.483
System: Your problem isn't luck, but making decisions without data.

11
00:01:21.633 --> 00:01:24.726
Getting roasted by the system on day one?

12
00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:29.250
System: First lesson: Analyze first, act later.

13
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:40.595
System: Attack pattern analyzed... Dodge left in two seconds.

14
00:01:40.745 --> 00:01:44.250
Two seconds?! Whoa, whoa, whoa!

15
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.745
I... survived? Using data instead of luck actually works!

16
00:01:52.895 --> 00:01:59.250
System: Next quest awaits, User Time.

